# Mvp24Hours documentation routing

Use this context when implementing or reviewing .NET solutions with Mvp24Hours.

## Retrieval order

1. Use the **local Mvp24Hours MCP DevKit** when configured in `.cursor/mcp.json` (stdio) or via HTTP (`dotnet run --project mcp/src/Mvp24Hours.Mcp -- --http`).
2. Read canonical documentation under `docs/en-us/`.
3. Use `docs/en-us/guides/architecture/` for architecture choices only.
4. Verify exact APIs against `src/` and behavior against `src/Tests/`.

## Local MCP quick reference

- Server: `mcp/src/Mvp24Hours.Mcp/`
- Env: `MVP24HOURS_REPO_ROOT` = repository root
- Manifest: `docs/en-us/ai-resources/templates-manifest.json`
- Setup: `mcp/README.md`, `docs/en-us/ai-resources/home.md`

